flowchart-diagram

// Title of the flowchart
title User Login and Approval Process

// Login Process
Login Process [color: lightblue, icon: log-in] {
  Start Login [shape: oval, icon: user]
  Enter Credentials [icon: key]
  Validate Credentials [shape: diamond, icon: check-square]
  Access Denied [shape: oval, icon: x-square]
  Access Granted [shape: oval, icon: check-square]
}

Start Login > Enter Credentials
Enter Credentials > Validate Credentials
Validate Credentials > Access Denied: Invalid
Validate Credentials > Access Granted: Valid

// Form Submission and Approval Process
Form and Approval [color: lightgreen, icon: file-text] {
  Start Form Submission [shape: oval, icon: edit]
  Fill Form [icon: edit-3]
  Submit Form [icon: send]
  Legal Review [shape: diamond, icon: briefcase]
  Approved [shape: oval, icon: thumbs-up]
  Rejected [shape: oval, icon: thumbs-down]
  Call API [icon: cloud]
}

Access Granted > Start Form Submission
Start Form Submission > Fill Form
Fill Form > Submit Form
Submit Form > Legal Review
Legal Review > Approved: Yes
Legal Review > Rejected: No
Approved > Call API

